                "html": "<section class=\"split-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"publication-title\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Reference front end</p><h2 id=\"publication-title\">Clean, fast and multilingual publishing</h2></div><p>This homepage demonstrates a responsive, multilingual and search-friendly public showcase: canonical routes, meta title, meta description, hreflang, sitemap, robots.txt, Open Graph, JSON-LD, public search and clear navigation.</p></section>"
