O-Metadaten, Suche, Weiterleitungen und Tombstones. Diese Architektur hält das öffentliche Runtime leicht und SEO-Signale ab der Veröffentlichung kohärent."},"sort_order":0}],"audit":{"created_by_iam_user_id":1,"updated_by_iam_user_id":1,"published_by_iam_user_id":1}}', '{"resource_type":"content_entry","resource_id":0,"language_code":"de","meta_title":"Mehrsprachiges und multisite SEO in einem Redaktions-CMS","meta_description":"Demonstrationsartikel über veröffentlichte Projektionen, kanonische Routen, hreflang, native Suche und mehrsprachiges SEO.","canonical_url":"/articles/seo-multisite","meta_robots":"index,follow","json_ld":null,"seo_score":100,"is_indexable":true,"issues":[]}', 21, '2a2479a9d90ef9cc45654f0831d6df5db64243c5e450f014ce2443052ae673e4', '2026-05-09 06:14:27', '2026-05-12 10:52:48');
INSERT INTO "public_content_snapshots" ("id", "site_id", "language_code", "resource_type", "resource_id", "route_path", "title", "slug", "blocks_json", "block_count", "document_json", "seo_json", "source_published_revision_id", "source_revision_checksum_sha256", "published_at", "projected_at") VALUES (216, 1, 'en', 'content_entry', 7, '/articles/seo-multisite', 'SEO, multilingual and multi-site', 'seo-multisite', '[{"id":"article_body_01","type":"markdown","enabled":true,"editorial_status":"published","label":"Corps de l’article","css_class":"","anchor":"","data":{"text":"The CMS uses revisions as the source of truth and published projections for routes, SEO metadata, search, redirects and tombstones. This architecture keeps the public runtime lightweight and SEO signals coherent as soon as content is published."},"sort_order":0}]', 1, '{"schema_version":1,"entry_id":7,"language_code":"en","content":{"title":"SEO, multilingual and multi-site","slug":"seo-multisite","blocks":[{"id":"article_body_01","type":"markdown","enabled":true,"editorial_status":"published","label":"Corps de l’article","css_class":"","anchor":"","data":{"text":"The CMS uses revisions as the source of truth and published projections for routes, SEO metadata, search, redirects and tombstones. This architecture keeps the public runtime lightweight and SEO signals coherent as soon as content is published."},"sort_order":0}]},"settings":[],"fields":{"author_name":"DEC CMS team"},"seo":{"meta_title":"Multilingual and multi-site SEO in an editorial CMS","meta_description":"Demonstration article about published projections, canonical routes, hreflang, native search and multilingual SEO.","meta_robots":"index,follow"},"blocks":[{"id":"article_body_01","type":"markdown","enabled":true,"editorial_status":"published","label":"Corps de l’article","css_class":"","anchor":"","data":{"text":"The CMS uses revisions as the source of truth and published projections for routes, SEO metadata, search, redirects and tombstones. This architecture keeps the public runtime lightweight and SEO signals coherent as soon as content is published."},"sort_order":0}],"audit":{"created_by_iam_user_id":1,"updated_by_iam_user_id":1,"published_by_iam_user_id":1}}', '{"resource_type":"content_entry","resource_id":0,"language_code":"en","meta_title":"Multilingual and multi-site SEO in an editorial CMS","meta_description":"Demonstration article about published projections, canonical routes, hreflang, native search and multilingual SEO.","canonical_url":"/articles/seo-multisite","meta_robots":"index,follow","json_ld":null,"seo_score":100,"is_indexable":true,"issues":[]}', 20, 'ec910e7caebf66dd039bcbb27b52f1a7e535d890ed2cd13785236216a92a10e7', '2026-05-09 06:14:27', '2026-05-12 10:52:48');
INSERT INTO "public_content_snapshots" ("id", "site_id", "language_code", "resource_type", "resource_id", "route_path", "title", "slug", "blocks_json", "block_count", "document_json", "seo_json", "source_published_revision_id", "source_revision_checksum_sha256", "published_at", "projected_at") VALUES (217, 1, 'fr', 'content_entry', 7, '/articles/seo-multisite', 'SEO, multilingue et multi-site', 'seo-multisite', '[{"id":"article_body_01","type":"markdown","enabled":true,"editorial_status":"published","label":"Corps de l’article","css_class":"","anchor":"","data":{"text":"Le CMS repose sur des révisions comme source de vérité et sur des projections publiées pour les routes, les métadonnées SEO, la recherche, les redirections et les tombstones. Cette architecture permet un runtime léger et des signaux SEO cohérents dès la publication."},"sort_order":0}]', 1, '{"schema_version":1,"entry_id":7,"language_code":"fr","content":{"title":"SEO, multilingue et multi-site","slug":"seo-multisite","blocks":[{"id":"article_body_01","type":"markdown","enabled":true,"editorial_status":"published","label":"Corps de l’article","css_class":"","anchor":"","data":{"text":"Le CMS repose sur des révisions comme source de vérité et sur des projections publiées pour les routes, les métadonnées SEO, la recherche, les redirections et les tombstones. Cette architecture permet un runtime léger et des signaux SEO cohérents dès la publication."},"sort_order":0}]},"settings":[],"fields":{"author_name":"Équipe DEC CMS"},"seo":{"meta_title":"SEO multilingue et multi-site dans un CMS éditorial","meta_description":"Article de démonstration sur les projections publiées, les routes canoniques, le hreflang, la recherche native et le SEO multilingue.","meta_robots":"index,follow"},"blocks":[{"id":"article_body_01","type":"markdown","enabled":true,"editorial_status":"published","label":"Corps de l’article","css_class":"","anchor":"","data":{"text":"Le CMS repose sur des révisions comme source de vérité et sur des projections publiées pour les routes, les métadonnées SEO, la recherche, les redirections et les tombstones. Cette architecture permet un runtime léger et des signaux SEO cohérents dès la publication."},"sort_order":0}],"audit":{"created_by_iam_user_id":1,"updated_by_iam_user_id":1,"published_by_iam_user_id":1}}', '{"resource_type":"content_entry","resource_id":0,"language_code":"fr","meta_title":"SEO multilingue et multi-site dans un CMS éditorial","meta_description":"Article de démonstration sur les projections publiées, les routes canoniques, le hreflang, la recherche native et le SEO multilingue.","canonical_url":"/articles/seo-multisite","meta_robots":"index,follow","json_ld":null,"seo_score":100,"is_indexable":true,"issues":[]}', 19, 'd484f5229624b19c30b92eba9ace94e30404be4da467392508c337baa7974178', '2026-05-09 06:14:27', '2026-05-12 10:52:48');
INSERT INTO "public_content_snapshots" ("id", "site_id", "language_code", "resource_type", "resource_id", "route_path", "title", "slug", "blocks_json", "block_count", "document_json", "seo_json", "source_published_revision_id", "source_revision_checksum_sha256", "published_at", "projected_at") VALUES (218, 1, 'de', 'content_entry', 8, '/articles/runtime-leger', 'Leichtes Runtime und öffentliche Projektionen', 'runtime-leger', '[{"id":"article_body_01","type":"markdown","enabled":true,"editorial_status":"published","label":"Corps de l’article","css_class":"","anchor":"","data":{"text":"Ein schnelles öffentliches Runtime vermeidet es, redaktionelle Beziehungen bei jeder Anfrage neu zu berechnen. Veröffentlichte Snapshots werden zum Lesevertrag: Route, SEO, Blöcke und Suche sind vorbereitet."},"sort_order":0}]', 1, '{"schema_version":1,"entry_id":8,"language_code":"de","content":{"title":"Leichtes Runtime und öffentliche Projektionen","slug":"runtime-leger","blocks":[{"id":"article_body_01","type":"markdown","enabled":true,"editorial_status":"published","label":"Corps de l’article","css_class":"","anchor":"","data":{"text":"Ein schnelles öffentliches Runtime vermeidet es, redaktionelle Beziehungen bei jeder Anfrage neu zu berechnen. Veröffentlichte Snapshots werden zum Lesevertrag: Route, SEO, Blöcke und Suche sind vorbereitet."},"sort_order":0}]},"settings":[],"fields":{"author_name":"DEC CMS Team"},"seo":{"meta_title":"Leichtes Runtime und öffentliche Snapshots","meta_description":"Wie öffentliche Projektionen das CMS schneller, stabiler und cache-freundlicher machen.","meta_robots":"index,follow"},"blocks":[{"id":"article_body_01","type":"markdown","enabled":true,"editorial_status":"published","label":"Corps de l’article","css_class":"","anchor":"","data":{"text":"Ein schnelles öffentliches Runtime vermeidet es, redaktionelle Beziehungen bei jeder Anfrage neu zu berechnen. Veröffentlichte Snapshots werden zum Lesevertrag: Route, SEO, Blöcke und Suche sind vorbereitet."},"sort_order":0}],"audit":{"created_by_iam_user_id":1,"updated_by_iam_user_id":1,"published_by_iam_user_id":1}}', '{"resource_type":"content_entry","resource_id":0,"language_code":"de","meta_title":"Leichtes Runtime und öffentliche Snapshots","meta_description":"Wie öffentliche Projektionen das CMS schneller, stabiler und cache-freundlicher machen.","canonical_url":"/articles/runtime-leger","meta_robots":"index,follow","json_ld":null,"seo_score":100,"is_indexable":true,"issues":[]}', 24, '2b689bcbfc802d8d3cb565a716a849bc0ffd5e8fad3c31292f2b9c46a59059e8', '2026-05-09 06:14:27', '2026-05-12 10:52:48');
